'''A Honk and Seek Adventure''' was an Event active for the first week of April 2025. While active, {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} appeared in the [[Hub]] and special items that reference other items in the game became obtainable.

== Items ==
'''Chuckleton''' tasked the player with obtaining various items. Nearly every item referenced another item in SkyBlock.
